0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;1. 모집 분야: 석사 및 박사과정</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;2. 지원 자격: 해당 지원 자격 소지자(졸업예정자 포함)로서, 지원일 현재</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-석사과정: 만 30세 미만</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-박사과정: 만 35세 미만</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;3. 지원 분야: 자연과학, 기계, 기술, 약학, 농업, 사회학, 인문학 등 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;4. 지원 기간 및 방법 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-지원 마감: 2013. 9. 27 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-웹 사이트 접속 (첨부2 참조)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-지원서, 사진 등을 인터넷으로 접수</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-터키 정부의 인터뷰 실시 (전화)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-자격 요건 및 인터뷰 종합하여 장학생 선정 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※상세한 내용은 웹 사이트 참조 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;5. 장학금 내역</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-석사과정 월 1,500 리라 (최대 2년간, 1리라는 한화 750원 정도)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-박사과정 월 1,800 리라 (최대 4년간)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-학비: 최대 2,000 리라</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※상세한 내용은 첨부 문서2 웹 사이트 참조 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;6. 제출 서류</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-지원서</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-여권 사본 혹은, 주민등록초본(영문)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-졸업증명서(학사, 석사)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-성적증명서(학사, 석사)</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-지원 동기 및 목적 진술</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-이력서</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-어학 및 자격 증명서 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※모든 서류는 영어 혹은, 터키어로 작성하며 합격자는 원본 서류 송부 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;7. 기타 사항</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-장학금 내용과 지원 방법에 대해서는 첨부2 참조</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-웹 사이트 접속하여 개인별로 서류 제출 및 지원함.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-통상 전화 인터뷰를 실시하며, 개인 메일로 결과를 통보함.</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-장학생으로 선발될 경우 터키 정부의 안내에 따라 출국하며 상세한 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;유학 및 생활 정보를 수집하여 현지 사정에 철저히 대비해야 함. &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 1.터키정부초청장학생 하반기 모집 안내 1부</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\" style=\"MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 1.6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">붙임 : 2. 2215_ilan2013_eng 1부. &nbsp;끝.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\"> </span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
